- Files excluded before review even began: 1. They are NOT in the counts above. See "Skipped Files" for why.
- Files never reviewed at all: 1, listed under "Skipped Files" below.

## Summary

- **Findings to act on: 2** (2 high)
- By category: 2 bug
- **Quality gate: FAILED.** 2 findings cross a configured threshold. Thresholds applied: maxCritical 0, maxHigh 0, maxMedium null, failOnProviderError true, failOnNewOnly true.
